Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libvulkan1
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/opendlss-rs
Description: Rust host and model tools for the OpenDLSS-NR neural renderer
 opendlss runs the OpenDLSS-NR network on an image through CUDA (when the
 driver is present, loaded at run time) or wgpu (Vulkan, Metal), and
 validates portable model directories. No weights are bundled: `opendlss
 setup` extracts them from your own nvngx_dlssnr.dll into
 ~/.config/opendlss.
